<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News appoints investor relations VP.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News appoints investor relations VP.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp Ltd said on Thursday it had appointed H. Reed Nolte vice president, investor relations.</p>
<p>Nolte, who will be based in New York, will liaise with financial analysts and investors, and manage the communications of News Corp's' business activities to the investment community in Australia, the U.S. and Europe, the company said.</p>
<p>Nolte, who previously held a similar position at Viacom Inc, will report to William Sorenson, senior vice president, finance.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
